<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		255.39		vs	  265.83</p>
<p> Operating	   40.31		vs	   52.98</p>
<p> Current	     18.84		vs	   29.78</p>
<p> Net		   10.45		vs	   14.41</p>
<p> EPS		   47.43 yen	  vs	   66.71 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    220 million	  vs	 216 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokkaido Electric Power Co Inc supplies power to Hokkaido.</p>
